      "content": "a blood clot?? thats a bit dramatic lol. i dont think it's that serious, it just feels like a dull ache from the walking. i really dont want to go to the doctor/urgent care just for a sore leg, it's such a hassle and expensive. u sure i cant just take some ibuprofen and wait it out? what's the best way to treat this at home so it goes away fast?",
